# Cargo build output
/target
**/target

# Rustfmt backup files
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these for debugging
*.pdb

# cargo mutants — mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# Meson build directories. Convention is `builddir`; tolerate variants.
/builddir
/build
/_build

# mdbook build output (v0.37.0). The book source (book/book.toml +
# book/src/) is checked in; the rendered HTML is regenerated by
# `mdbook build book`. (Pages hosting is a recorded idea, not set up;
# this comment used to claim it in the present tense.)
/book/book

# Compiled GSettings schemas — produced by the build; source XML is
# checked in, the binary blob is regenerated.
data/gschemas.compiled

# Memory-diagnostic capture file produced by `--debug` runs.
debug-memory.log

# Comparison / reference clones for the UI/UX audit (not part of the project).
/.repos

# Editor / OS detritus
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/

# Retired agent client's local settings; the machine-global ignore was
# doing this work, which a fresh clone elsewhere would not see.
.claude/
